WEBVTT - intro1 - English subtitles
NOTE Literal translation of the Persian narration; timings match the speech.

00:00.690 --> 00:08.000
Hi, I'm Zohreh.

00:08.000 --> 00:15.490
I made this short video to introduce the project we're running, and to ask for help.

00:15.490 --> 00:26.090
With the help of my friend and longtime colleague Kiana, we started a small, independent project to provide therapy services

00:27.090 --> 00:35.090
to people in Iran who can't afford therapy costs.

00:35.090 --> 00:46.000
Several active, dedicated therapists have joined this network,

00:46.000 --> 00:55.090
and a number of clients have been referred and held their first sessions.
